    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="alpine-lead">Last updated April 2026. Plain-English version: we collect only what we need to schedule and deliver your inspection, we never sell or share it, and we keep records for as long as state law requires.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="alpine-section">
  <div class="alpine-container alpine-container--narrow">
    <div class="alpine-prose">
      <div class="alpine-sentinel"><strong>§ 01</strong>What we collect</div>
      <h2>Information you give us.</h2>
      <p>When you book an inspection through this site or by phone, we collect: your name, phone number, email address, the property address, and any agent / brokerage you've cc'd. During the inspection itself we collect photographs of the property and our written observations of its condition.</p>
      <p>We don't run analytics that fingerprint you. The site uses a privacy-respecting page-view counter (Cloudflare Web Analytics) that doesn't set cookies and doesn't identify individual visitors.</p>

      <div class="alpine-sentinel" style="margin-top:3rem"><strong>§ 02</strong>How we use it</div>
      <h2>Only to do the work.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To schedule and confirm your inspection.</li>
        <li>To deliver the inspection report (PDF, by email).</li>
        <li>To answer questions about the report for the next 30 days.</li>
        <li>To send a one-time email asking for an honest review (no follow-ups).</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="alpine-sentinel" style="margin-top:3rem"><strong>§ 03</strong>What we don't do</div>
      <h2>What we'll never do with your data.</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Sell it. To anyone. For any reason. Ever.</li>
        <li>Add you to a marketing newsletter without explicit opt-in.</li>
        <li>Share inspection details with a third party (including an agent) without your written go-ahead.</li>
        <li>Run retargeting ads or pixel-based remarketing.</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="alpine-sentinel" style="margin-top:3rem"><strong>§ 04</strong>How long we keep it</div>
      <h2>Inspection records: 7 years. Site data: 30 days.</h2>
      <p>Colorado state inspector regulations require that we maintain inspection records for seven years after the report is delivered. We meet that requirement. Site analytics (page views) are retained for 30 days, then aggregated and the raw records are deleted.</p>

      <div class="alpine-sentinel" style="margin-top:3rem"><strong>§ 05</strong>Your rights</div>
      <h2>Ask, and we'll deliver.</h2>
      <p>You can request a copy of any data we have about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it (subject to the 7-year inspection-record retention requirement). Email <a href="mailto:hello@alpine.example">hello@alpine.example</a> with the subject line "Privacy request" and we'll respond within 10 business days.</p>

      <div class="alpine-sentinel" style="margin-top:3rem"><strong>§ 06</strong>Changes</div>
      <h2>If this policy changes.</h2>
      <p>We'll update the date at the top of this page. Material changes (new analytics tools, new third parties) will trigger a one-time email to anyone with an active inspection report on file.</p>

      <div class="alpine-sentinel" style="margin-top:3rem"><strong>§ 07</strong>Contact</div>
      <h2>Questions about privacy?</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@alpine.example">hello@alpine.example</a> or call <a href="tel:9283159094">(928) 315-9094</a> and ask for Sarah.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
